    "text": "By Aaron Meaux ,\n1 days ago DAWSON, Ga. (WALB) - It took more time than he wanted but Terrell County new head coach Marco Kirk is in the win column. The Greenwaves 40-8 win over Jordan is his first as a head coach. Kirk’s mission to turn Terrell County into a winner is a team effort... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
